'''Mallet Cat''' is a Special Cat that was added in [[The Battle Cats Unite!/Patch 1.0.4 Update|Patch 1.0.4]] and is exclusive to the [[The Battle Cats Unite!|Nintendo Switch Version]] of [[The Battle Cats]]. With [[The Battle Cats Unite!/Versus Mode|Versus Mode]] being added via free update, Mallet Cat was sold as promotional material along with the Official Limited Time Edition The Battle Cats Unite Combo Case to incentivize players to buy the game physically starting July 16, 2020. A Package Version Bonus without the Nintendo Switch case was later released in December 3, 2020 which would distribute Mallet Cat once more. In December 9, 2021, when the [[The Battle Cats Unite!/Patch 1.0.5 Update|English language patch]] released, the Package Version bonus came to Southeast Asia region giving SEA players a chance to obtain Mallet Cat as well. In [[The Battle Cats Unite!/Patch 1.0.6 Update|Patch 1.0.6]], Mallet Cat was given the ability to target Zombies. As of now, Mallet Cat is ''<u>only</u>'' available in the '''Japanese''' ('''JP''') and '''Southeast Asia''' ('''SEA''') versions.

