==Evolution==
Evolves into '''Harisen Cat''' at level 10.

==Strategy/Usage==
Mallet Cat has the range of most melee units, giving it many bad matchups towards traited enemies that can outrange your melee cats. Since the purpose of this cat is to crowd control via knockback, its pathetic range, recharge, and TBA make it unbearable to use outside of the [[Empire of Cats]] chapter given how many enemies can rush or outrange Mallet Cat. This unit, however, has some strong uses in [[Cats of the Cosmos]] if you can stack as many Mallet Cats as possible; due to [[:Category:Cyclones|Cyclone]]s appearing in the final chapter, Mallet Cat can be proven useful in supplementing crowd control as it can outrange all four cyclones. After that, Mallet Cat can be stowed away to collect dust forever.

{{Job|Classification = Crowd-Controller}}

